You have two ways to handle the multiple stack:

1. Name them individually[1]. This way they will never stack.

2. Take only one at a time out of the bag, then wield it and use it.

[1] This is not as easy as it sounds, but this will work: Drop all but 
one then name the one and put it into bag. Pick one, name and put into 
bag. Rinse and repeat.

